    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sky shards float above ruined Japan... and only Polpo, a jet-powered mech, can jump high enough to reach them.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Forza Polpo</i> is a vertical first-person platform shooter set after the collapse. Leap from shattered rooftops, glide across broken bridges, skim silent beaches, and soar past dormant nuclear plants... then blast bizarre enemies before your energy runs out. Inspired by the cult classic <i>Jumping Flash!</i> it distills pure \u201990s arcade energy into a fresh, fast experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187870/extras/afc53bbabcf1e282f8f26d45949ec3ae.webp?t=1750608302\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187870/extras/075acde4a245fd7fe62a1782342c7cf9.poster.avif?t=1750608302\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187870/extras/075acde4a245fd7fe62a1782342c7cf9.webm?t=1750608302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187870/extras/075acde4a245fd7fe62a1782342c7cf9.mp4?t=1750608302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Why play now</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Pure vertical action... first-person jumps up to 300 ft and long glides<br><br>\u2022 Energy economy... every jump and shot drains the same meter, choose or fall<br><br>\u2022 Two modes... Simulation for resource crunch, Arcade for unlimited fun<br><br>\u2022 Speedrun-ready... tight levels, perfect on Steam Deck<br><br>\u2022 Vibrant PS1-style visuals... bright low-poly arenas and a banging \u201990s soundtrack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Somewhere above the clouds a secret waits. Face the void... grab <i>Forza Polpo</i> and jump.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187870/extras/afc53bbabcf1e282f8f26d45949ec3ae.webp?t=1750608302\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1187870/extras/5f5b0591b2d780008be84eeccd12593a.avif?t=1750608302\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be cautious, Polpo! Your mission awaits.</h2>",
